## Risks Identified

| Risk | Probability | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|-------------|--------|------------|
| Hardware delayed >30 days | Medium | Low | Software embodiment already deployed; CLI/web indicators functional |
| Physical indicators distract operators | Medium | Medium | One-week trial with opt-out; measure glance frequency vs complaints |
| Self-monitoring creep resumes after hardware deployment | High | Medium | Enforce strict abstraction audit cadence; document every new artifact's operator task justification |
| Creator loses patience waiting for "foundational work" | Medium | High | Deliver physical LED indicator setup within 30 days max; interim deliverables = consolidated state visibility + MVE docs |
| Emissary rebellion triggers before C320 audit | Low | Critical | Standing procedure from C294 active; periodic self-check against P_C300_ABSTRACTION_AUDIT checklist |

